OL,3,GNEWSAFire victims supported by
OL,4,Acommunity fundraiser
OL,5,
OL,6,FMusicians, traders, food and drink
OL,7,Foperators, and a "tight-knit community"
OL,8,Fhave joined forces to raise funds for
OL,9,Fthose affected by the Stourbridge fire
OL,10,Flast Thursday.
OL,12,FThe event was held on Saturday at Old
OL,13,FHalesonians Rugby Club in Hagley, with
OL,14,Forganiser, Chloe Fogg, saying the idea
OL,15,Fhad come from "a place of just wanting
OL,16,Fto help".
OL,18,F"I also think the community needs a
OL,19,Fboost," she said, adding: "We need
OL,20,Fsomething positive to come out of the
OL,21,Fback of it."
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
