OL,3,GNEWSAFire victims supported by
OL,4,Acommunity fundraiser
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after 19 properties across
OL,7,Ffive streets were destroyed in the
OL,8,Fblaze, which broke out in Stourbridge
OL,9,Fand multiple other areas across the
OL,10,FWest Midlands, on the hottest day of
OL,11,Fthe year so far.
